Error [jet.SwitchOffAsExpression]: `#Off` does not produce a value
  --> tests/ui/off_debug_attr_on_expression.jet:2:12
    |
  2 |     value: #Off 1
    |            ^^^^
 Why: Statement switch attributes control a whole statement; expressions must still produce values in every build
 Fix: Put it before the statement: `#Off <statement>`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0343
